        "formula": "helium isentropic limit n = cp/cv = 5/3"
      },
      "min": 1.0,
      "max": 1.67,
      "meaning": "Polytropic exponent of the ullage expansion: 1 (isothermal) to cp/cv (isentropic)"
    }
